        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CSA10, 10\" Solid Brass Window Casement Stay Adjuster</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCasement stay adjusters hold casement style windows (windows that swing open) in place at a set opening. Totally adjustable, a tightening knob holds the window in place anywhere on the arm, so it will never wear out and loose friction. This 10 Inch Window Casement Stay Adjuster is made of heavy duty solid brass construction for lasting quality. The contemporary design makes it perfect for any house. It is slim enough that it will not steal the show from the view outside the window, but those who do notice it, will see the sleek style. It is available in 8 high quality finishes and packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CSA10-Specifications.gif?v=1704354610\" width=\"540\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CSA10 Window Casement Stay Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Longer <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-12-inch-window-casement-stay-adjuster-deltana-csa12\"><b>12\" Casement Stay</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana CSA10 10\" Casement Stay:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Rod Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Sash Plate: 2-1/4\" x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Sill Plate: 1-3/4\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CSA10.pdf?v=1691095315\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  CSA10 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 10 Inch Window Casement Stay Adjuster, Deltana CSA10",
                "description": "10 Inch Window Casement Stay Deltana CSA10 - Casement stay adjusters hold casement style windows (windows that swing open) in place at a set opening. Totally adjustable, a tightening knob holds the window in place anywhere on the arm, so it will never wear out and loose friction. This 10 Inch Window Casement Stay Adjuster is made of heavy duty solid brass construction for lasting quality. The contemporary design makes it perfect for any house. It is slim enough that it will not steal the show from the view outside the window, but those who do notice it, will see the sleek style. It is available in 8 high quality finishes and packaged with mounting hardware.",
